{"script":"yd_005_04-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"y":-297,"trans":true,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2","y":-297,"x":280,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]嗯？你在问我做什么？[r][l]非常明显的答案。我在给野菜切丝，给地菇切片，给猪肉……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]不是说不用加班，为什么还要做这些？[r][l]嗯～怠惰会让双手迟钝。虽然作为契约者在努力战斗，但作为侍者的修行也不能停止。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]所以，这不是加班，是修行的一环……！[r][l]至于修行的成果，就随意老板你处置了。你觉得怎么样？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]是不是哑口无言了？[r][l]那么饱含茜塔全心修行信念的菜肴，请老板好好品尝啦～！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-加班"}